# CSPAPP Backend - Church Management System API

[![Node.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-20.x-green.svg)](https://nodejs.org/)
[![Express](https://img.shields.io/badge/Express-4.18-blue.svg)](https://expressjs.com/)
[![MongoDB](https://img.shields.io/badge/MongoDB-8.0-green.svg)](https://www.mongodb.com/)
[![JWT](https://img.shields.io/badge/JWT-Auth-orange.svg)](https://jwt.io/)

## 📋 Overview

CSPAPP Backend is a robust, production-ready RESTful API for church management systems. It provides secure authentication, payment processing, email/SMS notifications, and comprehensive data management capabilities.

## ✨ Features

### Core Features
- 🔐 **JWT Authentication** - Secure token-based authentication
- 👥 **User Management** - Role-based access (Admin/Member)
- 💰 **Payment Integration** - Paystack payment gateway
- 📧 **Email Service** - Nodemailer with SMTP support
- 📱 **SMS Service** - HollaTags integration
- 📅 **Event Management** - Create and manage church events
- 📊 **Analytics** - Donation statistics and reports
- 🔒 **Security** - Helmet, CORS, Rate limiting
- 📝 **Logging** - Winston logger with file rotation

### Admin Features
- Member CRUD operations
- Donation management and export
- Event scheduling
- Mass communications (Email/SMS)
- Automated birthday wishes
- System settings configuration

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Runtime**: Node.js 20+
- **Framework**: Express.js 4.18
- **Database**: MongoDB with Mongoose ODM
- **Authentication**: JWT (JSON Web Tokens)
- **Payment**: Paystack API
- **Email**: Nodemailer (SMTP)
- **SMS**: HollaTags API
- **Validation**: Zod + express-validator
- **Security**: Helmet, CORS, express-rate-limit
- **Logging**: Winston + Morgan
- **File Upload**: Multer + Cloudinary
- **Testing**: Jest + Supertest

