## 🚀 Installation

### Prerequisites
- Node.js (v20 or higher)
- MongoDB (local or Atlas)
- npm or yarn

### Step 1: Clone the repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-repo/cspapp-backend.git
cd cspapp-backend
Step 2: Install dependencies
bash
npm install
Step 4: Start MongoDB
bash
# Local MongoDB
mongod

# Or use MongoDB Atlas (cloud)

Step 5: Start the server
bash
# Development mode
npm run dev

# Production mode
npm start
update .env